```
MSG91_API_KEY=<key>
MSG91_SENDER_ID=<6-char-id>
MSG91_DLT_TEMPLATE_ID=<registered-template>
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=<sid>
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=<token>
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=<number>
```

