## Verification Plan

### Automated
1. Fire `on-sla-breach` webhook → verify MSG91 API call contains DLT Template ID
2. Simulate MSG91 failure → verify Twilio fallback executes
3. POST to `/api/acknowledge` with valid token → verify complaint status = `acknowledged`
4. POST same token again → verify `403` response
5. POST 6 times in 60s → verify 6th returns `429`
6. Run `nightly-compliance-audit` → verify `security_alerts` row inserted

### Manual
- Trigger real SMS via MSG91 → verify delivery on test phone
- Click deep-link in SMS → verify SLA timer cancels and notification reads
